Package: SFinxSDFA
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Fingerprint Analytics and Spatial Functional Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Morteza", "Hajihosseini", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mortezahaji87@gmail.com")
Description: R package for Spatial Fingerprints Analytics (SFinx) and Spatial Functional Data Analysis (SDFA) in spatial transcriptomics data. Reconstructs spatial landscapes, evaluates spatial operators, and fits spatially varying GAM regression models with tensor product splines.
